{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8XjfbBpxUDiRnwm7Xv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"prompt\": \"A square abstract painting that fills the entire frame edge to edge, with no border, frame, wall, room, or gallery setting. Purely nonrepresentational: no recognizable objects, figures, faces, bodies, scenes, landscapes, horizons, machines, diagrams, symbols, icons, letters, numbers, or text. Palette: deep indigo and near-black underlayers breaking into electric vermilion, bruised violet, and pale ochre, with a few cold teal threads cutting through. Composition: a dense, tangled cluster of rapid, overlapping brushstrokes gathers toward the upper left, then loosens into wide, quiet fields of thinly scraped paint toward the lower right, leaving a deliberate pocket of empty bare canvas. Brushwork: energetic, gestural slashes with dragged dry-brush edges, drips that stop mid-run, and thick impasto ridges alternating with washed, translucent glazes. Texture and density shift abruptly, with rough scumbled areas beside smooth, polished passages. Layering: visible pentimenti and scraped-back underpaint showing through the surface. Rhythm: repeated arcs and interrupted pulses that build and release tension across the canvas. Spatial tension: forms press against the edges and push forward, while a few pale strokes recede into atmospheric depth. High contrast between saturated passages and near-white voids. Overall mood: urgent, searching, unresolved yet held together, with raw honesty in the marks.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":596,"cache_read_input_tokens":16245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":596},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_managemen